 ✨ Features

 👤 User Module

* OTP Email Registration
* Secure Login
* Search Charging Stations
* Filter by Location & Charging Type
* Book Time Slots
* Online Payment
* Upload Payment Proof
* View Booking History
* Give Feedback
* Profile Management

---

 🏢 EV Owner Module

* Register Charging Stations
* Manage Station Details
* View Bookings
* Upload Payment Receipts
* Track Revenue
* View User Feedback

---

 🛠️ Admin Module

* Approve Owners
* Approve Stations
* Manage Users
* Booking Monitoring
* Revenue Reports
* System Analytics Dashboard

---

 ⚙️ Smart Booking System

Prevents:

* Time Slot Conflicts
* Double Booking
* Invalid Availability Requests

Ensures accurate charging slot reservation.

---

 📈 Analytics Dashboard

Displays:

* Total Charging Sessions
* Total Energy Consumed
* Total Revenue
* City-wise Usage Analysis
* Vehicle Type Insights
* Payment Method Statistics
* Peak Usage City

---

 🔮 Prediction Features

 Energy Prediction

Predicts energy consumption based on charging cost.

 Cost Prediction

Predicts charging cost based on energy usage.

---

 🔍 Smart Recommendation Engine

Recommends charging stations based on:

* User City
* Charging Type (AC / DC)
* Matching Availability

